      "Return only a comma-separated list of named entities that appear in the following text: \"The lightbulb wasn’t invented by just one person. It was developed over time by several inventors.\n\n- **Humphry Davy** made an early electric light in the early 1800s.\n- **Joseph Swan** created a practical incandescent bulb in the UK.\n- **Thomas Edison** improved the design and made the first widely commercial, long-lasting bulb in the U.S.\n\nSo, if people ask who invented the lightbulb, **Thomas Edison is usually the most commonly credited**, but **Joseph Swan and others were also key contributors**.\"": [
        {
