      "Return only a comma-separated list of named entities that appear in the following text: \"There isn’t just one single inventor of the vacuum cleaner, but **Hubert Cecil Booth** is usually credited with inventing the **first practical powered vacuum cleaner** in **1901**.\n\nA few related milestones:\n- **Daniel Hess** patented an early carpet sweeper with suction in **1860**.\n- **Ives W. McGaffey** patented a hand-powered “vacuum cleaner” in **1869**.\n- **Hubert Cecil Booth** created the first **motorized, practical** vacuum cleaner.\n\nSo if you mean the modern vacuum cleaner, the usual answer is **Hubert Cecil Booth**.\"": [
